            "review_title": "Review at Burger King Hang Buom",
            "review_text": "Wandering Traveler\nBridgeboro, Georgia2520 contributions\n0\nNeeds improvement\nNov 2017 • Solo\nArrived to a basically empty restaurant, no one in line. Placed and purchased order 12:55 arrived at table at 1:08 with no cup for drink. So it's not fast food. I ordered the double Whopper Jr and it came covered in BBQ sauce. The patties were dry. The fries were good & hot. No free refills on drinks. They do offer free WiFi.\nWritten November 4, 2017",
