            "review_text": "Hùng V\n24 contributions\n0\nMy worst lunch of 2017\nApr 2017 • Couples\nThe first time I ate the burger at BURGER KING, it sucks! \nActually it looks great but...\nThe burger they made in reality is 100% different from its picture. My wife's burger is even no veggies, only with a slim piece of meat and cheese. \nI have eaten burger at other places like Macdonal or KFC, it was not terrible like this. The burger BURGER KING made is even worse than Vietnamese burger and Vietnamese Banh mi (about 25000d compared to 85000d from Burger King)\n\nNever come back again. I believe this is not burger king (or this is a fake one)\nRead more\nWritten April 5, 2017",
